WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.650
Step 1. Open the dispense order.

1.2
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:06.550
Here you collect the payment and complete the order.

1.3
00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:10.825
From Dispense in the location sidebar, select View Order.

1.4
00:00:10.825 --> 00:00:15.075
If the order is Draft, select Mark as In Progress.

2.1
00:00:15.075 --> 00:00:17.343
Step 2. Check the dispenses.

2.2
00:00:17.343 --> 00:00:22.533
The table shows each medicine with its lot and expiry, the instructions,

2.3
00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:27.070
the quantity dispensed, and the status of each dispense.

3.1
00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:29.378
Step 3. Issue the invoice.

3.2
00:00:29.378 --> 00:00:34.444
If the banner shows Invoice Not Generated, select Issue Invoice.

3.3
00:00:34.444 --> 00:00:40.089
Care creates the invoice, issues it, and opens the payment sheet.

4.1
00:00:40.089 --> 00:00:45.077
Step 4. Collect the payment. Record the payment in the payment sheet.

4.2
00:00:45.077 --> 00:00:48.442
When the payments on the invoice equal its total,

4.3
00:00:48.442 --> 00:01:14.802
Care marks the invoice as balanced.

5.1
00:01:14.802 --> 00:01:17.254
Step 5. Complete the dispense.

5.2
00:01:17.254 --> 00:01:22.688
When the footer says Payment has been collected, select Complete Dispense.

5.3
00:01:22.688 --> 00:01:27.300
Care sets the order and its open dispenses to Completed.
